#: kio_floppy.cpp:200
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access drive %1.\n"
"The drive is still busy.\n"
"Wait until it is inactive and then try again."
msgstr ""
"pemacu %1.\n"
"Pemacu masih sibuk.\n"
"Tunggu sehingga berhenti dan cuba lagi."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:204 kio_floppy.cpp:1146
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not write to file %1.\n"
"The disk in drive %2 is probably full."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di dalam pemacu %1 berkemungkinan penuh."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:214
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %2"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kemungkinan tiada cakera di dalam pemacu %1"

#: kio_floppy.cpp:218
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"There is probably no disk in the drive %2 or you do not have enough "
"permissions to access the drive."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kemungkinan tiada cakera di dalam pemacu %1 atau anda tiada keizinan yang "
"cukup untuk mencapai pemacu itu."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"The drive %2 is not supported."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pemacu %1 tidak disokong."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:227
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"Make sure the floppy in drive %2 is a DOS-formatted floppy disk \n"
"and that the permissions of the device file (e.g. /dev/fd0) are set "
"correctly (e.g. rwxrwxrwx)."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pastikan cakera liut di pemacu %1 ialah cakera liut berformat DOS \n"
"dan keizinan untuk fail peranti (cth. /dev/fd0) ditetapkan dengan betul "
"(cth. rwxrwxrwx)."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:231
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not access %1.\n"
"The disk in drive %2 is probably not a DOS-formatted floppy disk."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di pemacu %1 mungkin bukan cakera liut berformat DOS."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:235
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Access denied.\n"
"Could not write to %1.\n"
"The disk in drive %2 is probably write-protected."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Cakera di pemacu %1 mungkin dilindung-tulis."

#: kio_floppy.cpp:244
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Could not read boot sector for %1.\n"
"There is probably not any disk in drive %2."
msgstr ""
